    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44071" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sexis</span></b> , n.
		indecl.
		id.. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The number six</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut ex duobus, triplo sexis implevit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 7, § 767</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Six</i> asses: <i>s</i> littera i
			praecedente finita neutra monoptota sunt, ut tressis, sexis,
					<i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 3, §
		305</span></i>.</div>
